{"4198090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bradley the Badger", "steam_appid": 4198090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198090/extras/f08da8317c38fded4fd0e78154de2a59.poster.avif?t=1787825591\" width=780 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198090/extras/f08da8317c38fded4fd0e78154de2a59.webm?t=1787825591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198090/extras/f08da8317c38fded4fd0e78154de2a59.mp4?t=1787825591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bradley the Badger</i> is a <strong>love letter to games</strong>. It’s an action-adventure that blends exploration, traversal and mind-bending freeform puzzles, all brought to life through a satirical narrative that features moments in live-action. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A beloved platforming icon wakes up to a world that no longer makes sense. Longing to return home, Bradley embarks on a journey to save his world and his friends at all costs, even if that means coming face to face with a revelation bigger than anything he ever imagined.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across wildly different playable worlds, “inspired” by famous games but stuck in development hell, you’ll experience a unique narrative told through the enthusiastic, curious, and endlessly playful eyes of a videogame mascot. Will Bradley rescue Dreamwoods?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay – an action-adventure like no other</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will explore, double-jump, solve challenges, fight with your trusted frying pan across unfinished game worlds that are very much in need of a creative spark. Maybe that’s what you’ll contribute to save the day? There will be items to collect, quests to answer, secrets to unravel. And as much as Bradley would hope that this is gaming as usual, things will definitely be unlike anything he has ever experienced.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198090/extras/1f4a626ca5ca3c1edfb46aff59c1ec3e.poster.avif?t=1787825591\" width=780 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198090/extras/1f4a626ca5ca3c1edfb46aff59c1ec3e.webm?t=1787825591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198090/extras/1f4a626ca5ca3c1edfb46aff59c1ec3e.mp4?t=1787825591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Kit</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of our game is <strong>the Kit</strong>. It’s a tool that lets Bradley <strong>modify every unfinished asset</strong> he can find, just as if he was a game developer. It’s systemic, immediate, and completely transforms how you approach exploration, traversal, puzzles, and combat. It might even change the way you <i>think</i> about this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198090/extras/0dc54d91c9cfeccd9dacdc2fcbc6bd3e.poster.avif?t=1787825591\" width=780 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198090/extras/0dc54d91c9cfeccd9dacdc2fcbc6bd3e.webm?t=1787825591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198090/extras/0dc54d91c9cfeccd9dacdc2fcbc6bd3e.mp4?t=1787825591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Here are some functions you’ll unlock:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SCALE</strong> – Shrink or enlarge unfinished objects to open new paths, crush enemies, and redesign the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TRANSFER</strong> – Assume control of every unfinished asset in the world (anything from a toy robot to a car) to gain new abilities and movement options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TESSELLATE </strong>– Make walls temporarily climbable to reach secret routes and vantage points. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLOSIVE</strong> – Turn innocuous objects into bombs, hazards into opportunities, and enemies into debris.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXTRUDE</strong> – Push or pull geometry from unfinished surfaces to create your own platforms, paths, and cover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MANIPULATOR</strong> – Grab, rotate and stack unfinished objects as if they were building blocks to solve problems in your own way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And many more</strong>! Additional powers like COPY, GRAVITY, LIQUIFY and even the ability to DEBUG await, as Bradley pushes forward in his quest.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198090/extras/ca1abcda2190cbfc2b9f3335d054fd86.poster.avif?t=1787825591\" width=780 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198090/extras/ca1abcda2190cbfc2b9f3335d054fd86.webm?t=1787825591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198090/extras/ca1abcda2190cbfc2b9f3335d054fd86.mp4?t=1787825591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist Now!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If Bradley’s plight for his mascot future resonates with you, <strong>add this game to your Wishlist</strong> <strong>now</strong> to get updates, dev logs, new art and clips, and the big reveal of our cast. Your passion and feedback will help us shape the game until its release.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198090/extras/f08da8317c38fded4fd0e78154de2a59.poster.avif?t=1787825591\" width=780 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198090/extras/f08da8317c38fded4fd0e78154de2a59.webm?t=1787825591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198090/extras/f08da8317c38fded4fd0e78154de2a59.mp4?t=1787825591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Bradley the Badger</i> is a <strong>love letter to games</strong>. It’s an action-adventure that blends exploration, traversal and mind-bending freeform puzzles, all brought to life through a satirical narrative that features moments in live-action. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A beloved platforming icon wakes up to a world that no longer makes sense. Longing to return home, Bradley embarks on a journey to save his world and his friends at all costs, even if that means coming face to face with a revelation bigger than anything he ever imagined.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across wildly different playable worlds, “inspired” by famous games but stuck in development hell, you’ll experience a unique narrative told through the enthusiastic, curious, and endlessly playful eyes of a videogame mascot. Will Bradley rescue Dreamwoods?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Core Gameplay – an action-adventure like no other</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will explore, double-jump, solve challenges, fight with your trusted frying pan across unfinished game worlds that are very much in need of a creative spark. Maybe that’s what you’ll contribute to save the day? There will be items to collect, quests to answer, secrets to unravel. And as much as Bradley would hope that this is gaming as usual, things will definitely be unlike anything he has ever experienced.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198090/extras/1f4a626ca5ca3c1edfb46aff59c1ec3e.poster.avif?t=1787825591\" width=780 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198090/extras/1f4a626ca5ca3c1edfb46aff59c1ec3e.webm?t=1787825591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198090/extras/1f4a626ca5ca3c1edfb46aff59c1ec3e.mp4?t=1787825591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Kit</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the heart of our game is <strong>the Kit</strong>. It’s a tool that lets Bradley <strong>modify every unfinished asset</strong> he can find, just as if he was a game developer. It’s systemic, immediate, and completely transforms how you approach exploration, traversal, puzzles, and combat. It might even change the way you <i>think</i> about this game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198090/extras/0dc54d91c9cfeccd9dacdc2fcbc6bd3e.poster.avif?t=1787825591\" width=780 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198090/extras/0dc54d91c9cfeccd9dacdc2fcbc6bd3e.webm?t=1787825591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198090/extras/0dc54d91c9cfeccd9dacdc2fcbc6bd3e.mp4?t=1787825591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Here are some functions you’ll unlock:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SCALE</strong> – Shrink or enlarge unfinished objects to open new paths, crush enemies, and redesign the environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TRANSFER</strong> – Assume control of every unfinished asset in the world (anything from a toy robot to a car) to gain new abilities and movement options.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TESSELLATE </strong>– Make walls temporarily climbable to reach secret routes and vantage points. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXPLOSIVE</strong> – Turn innocuous objects into bombs, hazards into opportunities, and enemies into debris.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EXTRUDE</strong> – Push or pull geometry from unfinished surfaces to create your own platforms, paths, and cover.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>MANIPULATOR</strong> – Grab, rotate and stack unfinished objects as if they were building blocks to solve problems in your own way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>And many more</strong>! Additional powers like COPY, GRAVITY, LIQUIFY and even the ability to DEBUG await, as Bradley pushes forward in his quest.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198090/extras/ca1abcda2190cbfc2b9f3335d054fd86.poster.avif?t=1787825591\" width=780 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198090/extras/ca1abcda2190cbfc2b9f3335d054fd86.webm?t=1787825591\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198090/extras/ca1abcda2190cbfc2b9f3335d054fd86.mp4?t=1787825591\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist Now!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If Bradley’s plight for his mascot future resonates with you, <strong>add this game to your Wishlist</strong> <strong>now</strong> to get updates, dev logs, new art and clips, and the big reveal of our cast. Your passion and feedback will help us shape the game until its release.</p>", "short_description": "Bradley, the beloved platforming icon, finds himself lost in strange new lands... and decides to fight back! Shape unfinished worlds with your game developer powers, explore a genre-bending story, and save your home in this unique action-adventure. Wishlist now and join Bradley’s journey!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Traditional Chinese, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198090/9ca42f0068e2531cfb2d458201a2f2a331f9754a/header.jpg?t=1787825591", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198090/cdbdbed104652bea360544ce491d7e50894fdeb0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1787825591", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198090/cdbdbed104652bea360544ce491d7e50894fdeb0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1787825591", "website": "https://www.bradleythebadger.com", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64Bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8600 or AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GeForce RTX 2060 Super or AMD Radeon RX 5700<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 60 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Integrated<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> SSD required</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Day 4 Night"], "publishers": ["Focus Entertainment"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 60, "description": "Gamepad Recommended"}, {"id": 55, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 56, "description": "DualShock Controller Support"}, {"id": 57, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 58, "description": "DualSense Controller Support"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4198090/43b11034e6cf9a4466ef61fef16559e8a6f43342/ss_43b11034e6cf9a4466ef61fef16559e8a6f43342.600x338.jpg?t=178782